# Trivy ignore file
# Reference: https://trivy.dev/docs/latest/configuration/filtering/
#
# One vulnerability/secret/misconfiguration ID per line. Entries listed
# here are suppressed from Trivy scan results, so every entry MUST be
# documented with a reason and revisited regularly.
